```python
A={"this","that"}
B={"that","other"}
C={"other","this"}
while "other" in C:
    if "this" in A:
        A,B,C=A-B,B-C,C-A
    if "that" in B:
        A,B,C=C|A,A|B,B|C
```

When the above program is executed, at the end, which of the following sets contains `"this"`?

