questions.question_text:
Consider the following Python code snippet.

```python
def f(a, b):
    if (a == 0):
        return b
    if (a % 2 == 1):
        return 2 * f((a-1)/2, b)
    return b + f(a-1, b)
print(f(15, 10))
```

The value printed by the code snippet is __________ (Answer in integer)

